text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Sana. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Sana, I am beyond frustrated. My internet has been dropping out every ten minutes for the last two days and I can't get any work done.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you're experiencing these interruptions, Priya. I know how disruptive that is when you're working from home.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we look into the network status, could you please provide your account number and date of birth for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, my account number is 62809304 and my date of birth is 22/12/1989.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you. I've accessed your account. Let me run a quick diagnostic on your line. One moment please.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I've already restarted the router three times. It just doesn't stay connected.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I see the instability here in the logs. It looks like there is a signal drop at the local exchange which is affecting your connection.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Is there any way to fix this quickly? I have a huge presentation tomorrow morning.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I can see the issue is external to your home, so I will raise a network ticket immediately to get the engineers to prioritize the repair at the exchange.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Oh, thank goodness. I was worried I'd be stuck like this. Thank you so much for your help, Sana!",
      "tags": []
    }
  ]
}
